                <pb facs="0790" n="706" xml:id="pg706"/>

                <head>No. 324.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brigham to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Paso del
                                Forte</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1886-07-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 26, 1886</date>. (Received July
                        26.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Governor of Chihuahua pushing trial of Cutting, who ignores proceedings. Result
                    may be reached to-day. If acquitted, what do?</p>
                <closer><signed>BRIGHAM,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
